====== BT VG3503J ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

BT Openreach ECI VDSL VG3503J modem.

This wiki describes how to install OpenWrt onto ECI modem model: 'B-FOCus V-2FUb/**r** Rev.B'.  

**<color #ed1c24>nb:</color>** These instructions are NOT for the earlier ECI modem model: 'B-FOCus V-2FUb/**I** Rev.B'.

