then connect using screen or Picocom. (Windows users can use PuTTY with baud rate set to 115200)
<code>
screen -U -L /dev/ttyUSB0 115200,cs8,-parenb,cstopb,-hupcl
</code>

<code>
picocom -b 115200 /dev/ttyUSB0
</code>

and login 
